OL,3,GNEWSA'I adopted stray cats I fell in
OL,4,Alove with on holiday'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-four hours in Sissi, Crete, was
OL,7,Fenough to make cat lover Eve Gaut fall
OL,8,Fin love.
OL,10,FShe had always fed strays on holidays,
OL,11,Fdistressed by the sight of them
OL,12,Fscavenging in bins and begging for
OL,13,Fscraps.
OL,15,FBut in September 2023, two black and
OL,16,Fwhite kittens that ran over to greet
OL,17,Fthe Shropshire resident after she
OL,18,Fstepped out of her hire car, stole her
OL,19,Fheart.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
