OL,3,GNEWSA'I adopted stray cats I fell in
OL,4,Alove with on holiday'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It sounds crazy, I just felt this
OL,7,Fconnection", she said. "[Stavros] was
OL,8,Freally meowing, I just felt like I was
OL,9,Fbeing asked for help. I knew we could
OL,10,Fprovide them with a better life if we
OL,11,Fcould get them over to the UK."
